1 REM FBCS FIL-0491
2 REM CLAIM A-10.1.2-TR154
3 REM TYPE OUTPUT
4 REM 8.2.2 prod. 1, 10.1.2 prod. 3: the IF MISSING line of a file INPUT may name a line outside its do-
5 REM loop; the empty file triggers it.
100 OPEN #1: NAME "FIL0491.DAT", ACCESS OUTIN, ORGANIZATION SEQUENTIAL, RECTYPE DISPLAY
110 LET N = 0
120 DO
130 INPUT #1, IF MISSING THEN 170: X
140 LET N = N + 1
150 LOOP
160 PRINT "NO"
170 CLOSE #1
180 PRINT N
190 END
